sequenceDiagram
participant Browser
participant CDN
participant LB as Load Balancer
participant App
participant Cache
participant DB
Browser->>CDN: Static assets
Browser->>LB: API request
LB->>App: Forward
App->>Cache: Check cache
Cache-->>App: Miss
App->>DB: Query
DB-->>App: Result
App->>Cache: Store
App-->>LB: Response
LB-->>Browser: Response